  "steps": [
    "Take 1 litre toned milk (I am using amul). Add salt, 1 tsp red chilli powder, 1/4 tsp pepper and mixed herbs + oregano to the milk before it comes to a boil.",
    "Once it comes to a boil, turn off the flame and add 2-3 tbsps of vinegar to this. Turn on the flame and stir for 2 mins on low flame until the green water separates.",
    "Strain the paneer and give it shape with a spoon and let it set in the fridge for 30 mins before use.",
    "Roast in butter and serve it with dal rice/ sabzi roti.",
    "Stuff in Moong chillas.",
    "Stuff in Parathas.",
    "Make Sandwiches."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "Makes 150 g paneer (the creator puts the cost at Rs 54)."
